# Tierra-VM Sandbox

- External entry point is `TierraVM` (`start` / `step` / `stop` / `snapshot` / `restore`).
- `SandboxLimitError` must not corrupt VM state; allow `set_limits` then continue.
- No host shell, subprocess, or sockets from VM code.
- Asset reads (config / `.tie` / `opcode.map`) only from allowed roots at construction time.
- Soup is a fixed-size `bytearray`; genomes are interpreted, never compiled to native code.
